# A Composer install from Packagist downloads GitHub's archive of the tagged
# commit, which is `git archive` and honours export-ignore. Everything at the
# top level stays out of that archive unless it is listed below, so a new
# development file or directory is excluded without anyone having to remember.
#
# The allowed set is the wp.org distribution (the DIST array in
# plugin-check/run.sh) plus composer.json, README.md and CHANGELOG.md.
# scripts/archive-check.sh fails CI when the two drift apart.
/* export-ignore
/woocommerce-beliq.php -export-ignore
/src -export-ignore
/languages -export-ignore
/readme.txt -export-ignore
/LICENSE -export-ignore
/composer.json -export-ignore
/README.md -export-ignore
/CHANGELOG.md -export-ignore
